@title EPISODE 18 • RAIN DELAY
@bg track_stadium_rain
Practice gets rained out. Everyone runs for the field house. London's keys are in the locker room. So is Diggy.
@show diggy
Diggy: You're soaked.
London: You're observant.
Diggy: You're shaking.
London: It's called being cold, Williams, it happens to people.
He takes a step closer. Then another. Thunder rolls across the empty stadium.
@if Diggy_Affection 18 kiss
@if Diggy_Affection 12 almost
Diggy: (stepping back) We should go. Coach'll lock the gates.
London watches him leave and has no idea why it hurts.
@jump end
*almost
Diggy: London.
London: Don't.
Diggy: Don't what?
London: Don't say my first name like that unless you mean it.
Diggy: (very close now) And if I mean it?
The lights in the locker room cut out. Somebody yells their names from the hallway. The moment breaks like glass.
@jump end
*kiss
> [Bold] Kiss him first. -> k1
> [Sweet] "Diggy... I think I like you. And I hate it." -> k2
> [Bitchy] "If you're gonna do it, do it." -> k3
> [Good] Step back. "Not like this. Not yet." -> k4
*k1
@add Diggy_Affection 5
@add First_Kiss 1
For a girl who's always ahead of everyone, it's the first time she's ever not been afraid of what comes next.
@jump end
*k2
@add Diggy_Trust 4
@add First_Kiss 1
Diggy: (laughing softly) Yeah. Me too. Hate it so much.
He kisses her like the rain isn't happening.
@jump end
*k3
@add Diggy_Affection 4
@add First_Kiss 1
He does it. Outside, the thunder sounds a lot like applause.
@jump end
*k4
@add Diggy_Trust 5
He nods. He doesn't push. He just tucks a wet strand of hair behind your ear and says, "Then I'll wait." You believe him.
*end
